{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c27e696-db0e-11ef-a603-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c27e657-db0e-11ef-a241-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":4,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c046777-db0e-11ef-be19-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田午","people_name_jianti_auto":"田午","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c046778-db0e-11ef-9ead-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：強毅訅正曰威。訅，渠留翻。齊桓公，田午。訅，謀也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：强毅訅正曰威。訅，渠留翻。齐桓公，田午。訅，谋也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c046776-db0e-11ef-a251-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-378,"link_death_year":-320,"link_td_description":"齐威王，妫姓，田氏，名因齐，战国策作婴齐，出土文物作陈侯因齐，田齐君主，为田齐桓公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10002279","link_td_number_id":327054,"people_name":"威王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威王","people_xingming":"田因齐","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c04677b-db0e-11ef-9424-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-378,"link_death_year":-320,"link_td_description":"齐威王，妫姓，田氏，名因齐，战国策作婴齐，出土文物作陈侯因齐，田齐君主，为田齐桓公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10002279","link_td_number_id":327054,"people_name":"因齊","people_name_jianti_auto":"因齐","people_xingming":"田因齐","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c04677c-db0e-11ef-a4ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"是歲，齊桓公亦薨，子威王因齊立。","content_fanyi":"这一年，田氏齐桓公也去世了，他的儿子齐威王田因齐继位。","content_jianti_auto":"是岁，齐桓公亦薨，子威王因齐立。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":77,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 安王 / 二十三年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c046775-db0e-11ef-a805-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-379},"tongjian_id":"8c046775-db0e-11ef-a805-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-378,"link_death_year":-320,"link_td_description":"齐威王，妫姓，田氏，名因齐，战国策作婴齐，出土文物作陈侯因齐，田齐君主，为田齐桓公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10002279","link_td_number_id":327054,"people_name":"齊威王","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐威王","people_xingming":"因齐","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b6c-db0e-11ef-a7d8-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-378,"link_death_year":-320,"link_td_description":"齐威王，妫姓，田氏，名因齐，战国策作婴齐，出土文物作陈侯因齐，田齐君主，为田齐桓公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10002279","link_td_number_id":327054,"people_name":"威王","people_name_jianti_auto":"威王","people_xingming":"因齐","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b6d-db0e-11ef-944c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1齊威王來朝。是時周室微弱，諸侯莫朝，而齊獨朝之，天下以此益賢威王。","content_fanyi":"齐威王前来朝见周烈王。当时周王室已很衰弱，诸侯没有谁前来朝见，唯有齐国独自前来朝见，天下人因此更加认为齐威王贤德。","content_jianti_auto":"1齐威王来朝。是时周室微弱，诸侯莫朝，而齐独朝之，天下以此益贤威王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":103,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 烈王 / 六年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b6a-db0e-11ef-bd8a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-370},"tongjian_id":"8c0b1b6a-db0e-11ef-bd8a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_compani